<!-- 支出新增 / 编辑（管理员 · Phase 8b 第 1 域）
     ⚠️ 「账户」可留空：留空表示**只登记台账、不动账户余额**（后端 applyExpenseLedger
        在 account_id 为空时直接返回）。这是业务上真实存在的场景（记一笔还没走账的支出），
        所以不能做成必填 —— 但必须在界面上说清楚，否则用户会以为钱已经扣了。 -->
<view class="page page-with-footer">

  <view wx:if="{{blocked}}" class="banner banner-danger">⛔ {{blocked}}</view>

  <view wx:if="{{loadError}}" class="empty">
    <view class="empty-icon">⚠</view>
    <view>{{loadError}}</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="card">
      <view class="section-title">{{isEdit ? '编辑支出' : '记一笔支出'}}</view>

      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="form-label">支出名称<text class="form-required">*</text></text>
        <input
          class="form-input"
          value="{{expenseName}}"
          placeholder="如：运输费"
          maxlength="50"
          bindinput="onNameInput"
        />
      </view>

      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="form-label">金额<text class="form-required">*</text></text>
        <input
          class="form-input"
          type="digit"
          value="{{amount}}"
          placeholder="元，需大于 0"
          bindinput="onAmountInput"
        />
      </view>

      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="form-label">日期<text class="form-required">*</text></text>
        <picker mode="date" value="{{expenseDate}}" bindchange="onDateChange">
          <view class="form-input">{{expenseDate}}</view>
        </picker>
      </view>

      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="form-label">类别<text class="form-required">*</text></text>
        <picker range="{{categories}}" value="{{categoryIndex}}" bindchange="onCategoryChange">
          <view class="form-input">{{category || '请选择'}}</view>
        </picker>
      </view>

      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="form-label">账户</text>
        <picker range="{{accountLabels}}" value="{{accountIndex}}" bindchange="onAccountChange">
          <view class="form-input">{{accountLabels[accountIndex]}}</view>
        </picker>
      </view>
      <view class="t-sub">
        留空（选「不记账」）时只登记台账，不动任何账户余额；选了账户则同步扣减该账户余额并生成资金流水。
      </view>

      <view class="form-row form-row-stack">
        <text class="form-label">备注</text>
        <textarea
          class="form-textarea"
          value="{{remark}}"
          placeholder="选填"
          maxlength="200"
          bindinput="onRemarkInput"
        />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{isEdit}}" class="card card-flat">
      <view class="t-sub">该记录的账户流水会随编辑/删除自动撤销并重记，无需手工调账。</view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view class="footer-bar">
    <view wx:if="{{isEdit}}" class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="onDelete">删除</view>
    <view
      class="btn btn-primary flex-1 {{submitting ? 'btn-disabled' : ''}}"
      bindtap="onSubmit"
    >{{submitting ? '提交中…' : (isEdit ? '保存修改' : '保存')}}</view>
  </view>
</view>
